      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "When i want to go to another world i get stuck on a black screen. I waited for 15/20 mins but nothing happened. I restarted vrchat a lot of times but it not helped. I tried everything but not help. Please fix it. I cant prevail in the game.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
